    narr:narration """On August 5, 2026, Quinton Fairweather [formalized a new gate policy](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for Meridian deployments, mandating a signed release manifest for all shipping artifacts. This decision is framed as a [direct response to past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), specifically citing the unauthorized entry of two unsigned artifacts into staging during the previous quarter. Fairweather has [codified the decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) and [defined its operational scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) to cover both staging and production environments. By [explicitly recording his ownership](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of this gate, Fairweather establishes a clear line of accountability for the new procedural requirement.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The rationale shifts from formal policy enforcement to a concrete, past-tense reaction to specific security failures." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The ownership record introduces a self-enhancement value dimension absent from the technical policy declarations." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "Decisive and authoritative, moving quickly from policy declaration to formal record-keeping." ; narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
